OL,3,GNEWSARoad hit by mineshaft damage
OL,4,Areopens early
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road that was set to be closed until
OL,7,Fthe end of November has reopened about
OL,8,Ftwo months earlier than planned.
OL,10,FAbout 150 residents of Troon, near
OL,11,FCamborne, staged a protest in May
OL,12,Fasking Cornwall Council to fix Newton
OL,13,FRoad as soon as possible after a hole
OL,14,Fappeared due to a suspected mineshaft
OL,15,Fopening up.
OL,17,FThe alternative route meant people had
OL,18,Fto drive a seven-mile (11.3km)
OL,19,Fdiversion through Four Lanes.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
