OL,3,GNEWSARoad hit by mineshaft damage
OL,4,Areopens early
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,7,Fsaid residents were "delighted" after
OL,8,Fthe road reopened on Friday.
